  "comments": "Commentary on the three chapters of the Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya, abundantly using \"thal...phyir\" arguments. It is possibly incomplete - it ends abruptly, but has a colophon.\r\nContains numerous references to Indian commentators of the Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya (ID:3774), Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) and Pram\u0101\u1e47asamuccaya (ID:3770), as well as to the views of rNgog Blo ldan shes rab (ID:3786), of Chu mig pa (ID:4018), and to the Tshad ma rigs gter (ID:5564).\r\nAlso referred to are an anonymous \"yongs 'dzin\" and the unidentified reference \"sgros.\"",
